        prompts: {
          human: 'Saskop (also known as Lambapea) is an Estonian trick-taking card game for four players. It is the Estonian member of the prestigious Schafkopf group of games. It distinguishes itself with a 36-card deck (removing 5s and lower) and a complex ranking system where the 6s and Kings occupy the highest tiers of the trump suit. It is a partnership game that emphasizes card counting and aggressive bidding to secure the 61-point victory threshold.',
